{parent=List of evolutionary biologists}
{c}
{wiki}

<Evolutionary biologist> whose research includes plant <speciation> and the evolution of biodiversity.

= Nancy Knowlton
{parent=List of evolutionary biologists}
{c}
{wiki}

<Evolutionary biologist> whose marine research includes <species delimitation> and divergence of snapping shrimp lineages.

